<div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/8 bg-dark-800 p-5 md:p-6">
  <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-light mb-5">Hoy vs con ZinkERP</p>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] sm:items-stretch">
    <figure class="rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-dark-900/60 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/14">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gray-500 mb-3">Hoy</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-300 mb-2">El ticket queda en la mano</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">El cajero mira la Systel y vuelve a cargar peso o importe en caja.</p>
    </figure>
    <figure class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-400/30 bg-dark-900 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald-400/50 hover:ring-1 hover:ring-emerald-400/20">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-emerald-300 mb-3">Con ZinkERP</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">El ticket entra a la venta</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">Se lee en el POS. Aparecen producto e importe. El cajero cobra.</p>
    </figure>
  </div>
</div>
